	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-single im-wrap" data-sidebar="on">
	<article class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 1.5rem">
		<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
			<ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
				<li><a href="/">{{> "icons/house"}}<span>Home</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="/collections/wishlist/">{{> "icons/square-check"}}<span>Bucket list</span></a></li>
				<li><span aria-current="page">See the northern lights</span></li>
			</ol>
		</nav>

		<header class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: .75rem">
			<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem">
				<span class="im-badge im-badge-accent">Booked</span>
				<span class="im-caption">Cold · Added January 2024</span>
			</p>
			<h1 class="im-collhead-title">See the northern lights</h1>
			<p class="im-collhead-text">Tromsø, February 2027, and three nights of patience. Booked in September, because the one thing everybody says is that you cannot do it in two.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="im-expstats">
			<span><strong>Feb 2027</strong>Booked for</span>
			<span><strong>3</strong>Nights</span>
			<span><strong>69°N</strong>Tromsø</span>
			<span><strong>~40%</strong>Odds per night</span>
		</div>

		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-content-lede">
			<p>It has been on the list since a photograph somebody showed me in 2024, which is a bad reason and the only one I have.</p>

			<h2>What it takes</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Three nights minimum.</strong> One night is a coin toss; three is about eighty per cent.</li>
				<li><strong>February, not December.</strong> Darker is not better — clearer is, and February is clearer.</li>
				<li><strong>Away from Tromsø itself.</strong> The town's own light is the thing that ruins it.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>What has to be true first</h2>
			<p>Nothing, any more. That is why it moved from <em>someday</em> to <em>booked</em> — and that is the only transition on this list that means anything.</p>
		</section>

		<nav class="im-postnav" aria-label="More">
